        "notes": "[No Scope Needed](item_823db5eb-5a24-4bac-b850-0aa34e76b4f6) makes it possible to do a lot of healing or damage to tanks, or anyone, quickly, as with the item you'll be getting round 2 you won't need to pretty much ever scope in. \nIf you're confident enough you can get headshots, or don't think you'll need the extra healing output the other power gives you, then [Pinpoint Prescription](item_5cfa07d8-7b5d-42df-a9a8-c6a580acb8bc) is another good option, but I've found [No Scope Needed](item_823db5eb-5a24-4bac-b850-0aa34e76b4f6) to be more consistently useful. \n\nNo WP or AS items this round, but a bit of armor and extra speed instead.",
