        "notes": "[Home Remedy](item_de68ba66-26d5-4136-a0c1-6396d3f1b0c7) is such an underrated power, IMO. Making any ally (including yourself!) affected by nade not only the usual boosted healing, but an addition 170+ (with our current AP) overhealth on top of that is *not* to be underestimated.\nThis either can give you enough time to heal your critical tank currently frontlining back to full HP while being focused, but also can help YOU win 1v1s way more than you'd think. Fighting someone but you're low or about to take a bunch of burst? Nade the floor next to both of you and now you can be healed easier, have a bunch of extra HP, and whoever you're fighting no longer can get any healing. It's a very powerful tool.\n\n [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) is a must-pick ASAP, if can't afford anything aside from the CORE listed items, then go with that.\nLFD is an item listed under Ability, but really, it's a confused Survival item if you ask me. Even if you don't care for AP, (and it only does so much for our build here), giving you 50 extra *armor* and the ability to regen essentially 25 hp/s every time you use an ability is absolutely amazing. \nThis is why we never, ever sell [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e). Normally, Ana's really long cooldowns would make [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) not that great of an item, but with another ability on a 3s cooldown, this goes from \"eh\" to \"great\", and puts your survivability way up.",
