        "notes": "Personally, I'd prioritize getting [Cluster Core](item_c63cd7ba-b71c-4503-bdb6-4ef0b0a4bdbb) in most games, because it really helps to reduce your nade cooldown, and your nade can be a fight-winning ability - or at least make it so the enemy feels like your team never dies. However, [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) and [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) are also good picks instead, as they add both some survivability and WP into your build. \nIf you're REALLY struggling with survivability, [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) is also a consistent option.\n\nA bunch of optional items that are also good with the build, if you have extra cash.",
