        "notes": "This is pretty much the final build you're going to have, excluding if you choose to make some changes for round 7 because you want a different item more.\n\nI think [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is generally just a solid \"good\" item, but either [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) or even [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) would be another option to replace it with, though I'd lean more towards the 10% CDR unless you're really going DPS Ana playstyle, or find that you hit enough people with [Cluster Core](item_c63cd7ba-b71c-4503-bdb6-4ef0b0a4bdbb) that you get nades back quickly enough for you.\nThe more survivability-focused replacements would be either [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) or [Rustung Von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4), though I think MM synergizes better with the other items in the build.",
