        "notes": "[My Turn](item_5cea2ccb-c889-4447-8a84-c704c1da1521) is just a good power choice, giving you more survivability and ability to kill in a situation that you might have otherwise run out of cooldowns, and though it's usually my go-to, the other options aren't bad either:\n- [Our Turn](item_6e0fdb41-c00f-41d9-8ec2-1246b34a539a): Nano for your whole team (within range + LOS) with 75% of the normal duration is great (obviously, this does not apply to yourself)\n- [Your Full Potential](item_f03b3a26-0d1b-46bc-85e6-92f060b53b4e): Got a Zarya 70% of the way to grav? Nano them and they'll have it immediately! A crit health soldier close to visor? Use your ult and they'll have it and overhealth to spare! \n- [Pinpoint Prescription](item_5cfa07d8-7b5d-42df-a9a8-c6a580acb8bc): Good for higher healing/dps output, and if you can hit them consistently you can pretty much one-shot squishies or quickly melt tanks\n- [Venomous](item_594b0c79-5440-475c-b64c-c0295c46d735): an extra ~94 dmg to the enemies you purple, especially if you're getting it back quick with [Cluster Core](item_c63cd7ba-b71c-4503-bdb6-4ef0b0a4bdbb) is pretty good",
